'''Yes Mother?''' is a [[transformation]] added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth]]'', dressing Isaac with his Mom's dress after picking up 3 Mom-related items.

== Effects ==
* Gives Isaac a stationary {{i|Mom's Knife}} that trails behind him as he moves, dealing 2x Isaac's tear damage on contact.
** The knife synergizes like Mom's Knife would.

== Requirements ==
Pick up 3 [[item]]s from the following list ({{dlc|r}} with the [[Item Tags mom|{{code|mom}} tag]]).

