== Notes ==
* This is a reference to the horror film ''[[wikipedia:Psycho (1960 film)|Psycho]]''.
* {{i|Mom's Box|nr}} does not count towards this transformation even though it has the name "Mom" in it.
* The Yes Mother? transformation was originally going to have the effect in which mom's foot would be called down when Isaac reaches one heart.

